  "name": "Hashed doc_id Mode for Telemetry",
  "description": "Opt-in setting that replaces result document ids in telemetry logs with keyed HMAC hashes, using a server-side salt file created on first start. Adds a marker field on log entries and a status flag shown by the API and CLI.",
